# Build output. Regenerated by build.sh / build.ps1, and ~18MB per revision.
dist/

# Local build tooling, artefact backups and scratch work. work/fnpack holds the
# official fnpack binary; build.ps1 falls back to PATH and then prints the
# download URL when it is absent, so a fresh clone still builds after fetching
# fnpack. work/backup keeps old .fpk revisions only for demonstrating that
# verify-fpk.py rejects a stale package.
work/

# ACL recovery snapshots written by the Windows sandbox. Machine-specific.
.acl-recovery/

# The bundled cloudflared binary: a 38MB third-party build that upstream already
# publishes. Tracking it would put it in every clone and in the permanent
# history, for a file nobody here edits. tools/fetch-cloudflared.py downloads
# the pinned release and verifies its SHA-256 before use; the packaged .fpk,
# which does contain the binary, ships as a GitHub Release asset.
cloudflared/app/bin/cloudflared

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
